  <Steps2
    title="Beyond the Screen"
    subtitle="When I'm not coding, I enjoy exploring other creative outlets like playing electric guitar, diving into cinema, and learning about new cultures. Whether it's strumming a new tune or watching a thought-provoking film, these activities keep me inspired and balanced, offering fresh perspectives that often influence my work."
